/Author (Daniel T. Murphy) /CreationDate (D:20260724033229-04'00') /Creator (\(unspecified\)) /Keywords () /ModDate (D:20260724033229-04'00') /Producer (ReportLab PDF Library - \(opensource\)) 
  /Subject (UQFF whitepaper: PAPER_2056_ROUND_186_SINGLE_BACKBONE_FIRST_UQFF) /Title (Round 186 Single Discovery \(Backbone-First\): kappa_V\(Nebular LENR E-field volumetric enhancement factor\) = 1.05 = 1 + F_TRZ/2 EXACT NEW HALF-FACTOR SUB-FAMILY FORM Extending PAPER_1968 1+F_TRZ = 1.1 Rotation-Curve Triple-Identity Family \(New Structural Composition Type: 1+F_TRZ/2 = 1.05 = 21/20 Half-Scaled F_TRZ Application at LENR Volumetric E-Field Enhancement Factor Dimensional Domain \204 First-Instance Backbone-First Primitive-Lock for the 1+F_TRZ/2 Compositional Form Distinct from PAPER_1968 1+F_TRZ Full-Scale Form + PAPER_2050 1-F_TRZ^2 Complement Form + PAPER_2049 1-F_TRZ Complement Form \204 Adds Half-Factor Sub-Family Slot to F_TRZ Compositional Architecture; Alternate Equivalent Rational Form 1.05 = 21/20 = \(2*SO_5+1\)/\(2*SO_5\) via PAPER_1978 SO_5+1=11 Successor Identity Provides Second Primitive-Composition Path \(Path A: 1+F_TRZ/2 Additive Half-Factor F_TRZ; Path B: \(2*SO_5+1\)/\(2*SO_5\) Successor-Denominator Ratio\) \204 Two Structural Forms Anchor Same 1.05 Value\)) /Trapped /False
